#. +> trunk stable
#: background.cpp:40
msgid "E&nable background"
msgstr "Ach&tergrundinstellen bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: background.cpp:42
msgid ""
"If this is checked, KDM will use the settings below for the background. If "
"it is disabled, you have to look after the background yourself. This is done "
"by running some program (possibly xsetroot) in the script specified in the "
"Setup= option in kdmrc (usually Xsetup)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, bruukt KDM de Instellen nerrn, wenn nich, muttst Du Di sülven "
"mit den Achtergrund aftasen. Dat kannst Du dör dat Utföhren vun en Programm "
"(a.B. xsetroot) binnen dat Skript, dat mit de Optschoon \"Setup\" in \"kdmrc "
"\"fastleggt is (normalerwies Xsetup)."

